.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SS OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-verify\fR
Also compare each pinned key against the forge\*(Aqs published keys. Needs `gh` and the network
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Machine\-readable output
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
